# Cloudflare Workers static-asset headers.
#
# The installer has no file extension, so it would otherwise be served as
# application/octet-stream — which makes browsers download it instead of
# showing it. Anyone about to pipe a script into their shell should be able to
# read it first by opening the URL, so it is served as plain text.
/install-mpx-cli
  Content-Type: text/plain; charset=utf-8
  Cache-Control: public, max-age=300
